Project modifications to the pretrained model: a nine-class leaf head and
fine-tuning of the last four backbone blocks and final normalization;
checkpoint selected at epoch 6 with 224 px training input. The project v1
runtime uses that same checkpoint at 280 px with horizontal-flip averaging.
The project owner requested distribution of this fine-tuned checkpoint in
GitHub Release assets for collaboration. Training-data rights remain
unresolved; publication is not a clearance finding or a grant of rights in
the underlying images. No retraining was performed for this release.

